          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$n=5$, $\\sum x=10.5\\Rightarrow\\bar{x}=2.1$; $\\sum y=9.81\\Rightarrow\\bar{y}=1.962$. $S_{xx}=\\sum x^{2}-n\\bar{x}^{2}=27.75-22.05=5.70$ and $S_{xy}=\\sum xy-n\\bar{x}\\bar{y}=21.51-20.601=0.909$. Slope $\\hat{\\beta}_1=\\frac{0.909}{5.70}=0.1595$; intercept $\\hat{\\beta}_0=\\bar{y}-\\hat{\\beta}_1\\bar{x}=1.962-0.1595(2.1)=1.6271$. (Option C, 0.1595, is the SLOPE — the trap.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$n=5$, $\\sum x=10.5\\Rightarrow\\bar{x}=2.1$; $\\sum y=9.81\\Rightarrow\\bar{y}=1.962$. $S_{xx}=\\sum x^{2}-n\\bar{x}^{2}=27.75-22.05=5.70$ và $S_{xy}=\\sum xy-n\\bar{x}\\bar{y}=21.51-20.601=0.909$. Hệ số góc $\\hat{\\beta}_1=\\frac{0.909}{5.70}=0.1595$; hệ số chặn $\\hat{\\beta}_0=\\bar{y}-\\hat{\\beta}_1\\bar{x}=1.962-0.1595(2.1)=1.6271$. (Phương án C, 0.1595, là HỆ SỐ GÓC — chính là cái bẫy.)</p></div>"
